{"ID":"20240513083414-1s0y0x0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083414-1s0y0x0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083414-1s0y0x0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105056-kd0fka7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105056-kd0fka7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105056-kd0fka7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:502,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:502\u0026#125;","title":"042","type":"doc","updated":"20240515125801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105056-kd0fka7","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 881px;","id":"20240513105056-kd0fka7","updated":"20240515125801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 027-1 D, B"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4/22/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更年期"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經在停服避孕丸後正常但最近四個月月經停止，有身熱 盜汗 體力差 不易入眠也睡不長的情形。晨起覺累，全天都累。睡時覺身熱，胃口上升許多，口渴無，體重上升 倦怠不想動，大便每日行，一天三次，雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有服用抗憂鬱藥 抗焦慮藥病史(1995年至今)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈大中空無力(勞脈)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瞳孔大反應差 腎陽虛外走 ；脾區過大；肝脾比例失衡故憂鬱；肝區破洞多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽上浮 腎陰不固陽 肝中毒素 脾區受損"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 黃芩三錢 龍膽草三錢 當歸二錢 遠志五錢 龍骨五錢 牡蠣八錢 茯神三錢 補骨脂三錢 澤瀉五錢 炮附子三錢 黃連二錢 白芍五錢 烏藥五錢 細辛二錢 阿膠三錢(分三包) 前三天加生蛋黃一只沖服，之後停用蛋黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝木與脾土失衡人則憂慮，長期服用西藥抗憂鬱藥肝臟受損。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈大中空，心血不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方用柴芩鬱龍清肝解毒。當歸，黃連阿膠湯補心血不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陰陽二虛，用補骨脂 炮附 澤瀉 烏藥 細辛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨牡蠣能歛浮陽止汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茯神遠志寧心安神。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體重上升 倦怠不想動"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→心臟差的表現，心臟好體重會下降。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}